{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09480","headline":"弹棊歌 · 韦应物","name":"弹棊歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圆天方地局，二十四气子。\n刘生绝艺难对曹，客爲歌其能。\n请从中央起，中央转鬬破欲阑。\n零落势背谁能弹，此中举一得六七。\n旋风忽散霹雳疾，履机乘变安可当。\n置之死地翻取强，不见短兵反掌收已尽。\n唯有猛士守四方，四方又何难。\n横击且缘边，岂如昆明与碣石。\n一箭飞中隔远天，神安志惬动十全，满堂惊视谁得然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09480.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09480","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}